        <mxCell id="EbJxW3jv7QS7McjEMLKu-466" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;textShadow=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=none;" value="&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;The first &lt;br&gt;Linux distributions&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div&gt;Over 100 developers work collectively on the Linux kernel. With their assistance, the kernel is adapted to the GNU environment.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Slackware&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;is released for the first time. In the same year, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Debian &lt;/b&gt;project is established. It will later become the largest community distribution.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
