        <mxCell id="ffJ0lFliinWhPomTt_Ha-25" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;textShadow=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;systemd&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Lennart Pottering &lt;/b&gt;releases&lt;b&gt; systemd&lt;/b&gt;. It is a software suite used for system and service management on Linux and unify service configuration and behavior across Linux distributions. Its main component is an &lt;b&gt;init&lt;/b&gt; system used to &lt;i&gt;bootstrap user space&lt;/i&gt; and manage &lt;i&gt;user processes&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;It will later be adopted by nearly all Linux distributions.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="210" width="201.83" x="1678.17" y="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ffJ0lFliinWhPomTt_Ha-26" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;" value="&lt;h3&gt;2010&lt;/h3&gt;" vertex="1">
